OL,3,GNEWSACadet leader posed as girl on
OL,4,ASnapchat, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmy cadets who thought they were
OL,7,Fsharing nude photos with a teenage girl
OL,8,Fon the messaging app Snapchat were in
OL,9,Ffact communicating with their
OL,10,Finstructor, a court has heard.
OL,12,FRylan Ray, who was a detachment
OL,13,Fcommander for the youth organisation in
OL,14,FCambridgeshire, is on trial accused of
OL,15,F25 sexual offences ` many involving
OL,16,Fchildren ` which he denies.
OL,18,FA jury at Ipswich Crown Court has heard
OL,19,Fhow a Snapchat account purporting to
OL,20,Fbelong to a teenage girl called Chelsea
OL,21,Fhad been linked to the 26 year old from
OL,22,FWestgate, Peterborough.
